      "Code": "// Applicable only if BOTH curvatures are zero.\napplicable = Rh == 0 && kv == 0;\nfrictionTerm = W * L * f * Math.Cos(angle);\ngravityTerm = W * L * Math.Sin(angle);\nT2check = applicable ? T1 + frictionTerm + gravityTerm : null;\nsectionDifference = applicable ? T2check-sectionExit : null;"
    },
