      "Code": "// Inclination: -angleDeg to 0 degrees.\n// Circular bend in a vertical plane, constant R.\ntheta = Math.DegreesToRadians(angleDeg);\nvalid = T1 >= 0 && W >= 0 && f >= 0 && R > 0 && angleDeg >= 0 && angleDeg <= 90;\nE = Math.Exp(f * theta);\ns = Math.Sin(angleDeg);\nc = Math.Cos(angleDeg);\nB = W * R / (1 + f*f);\nterm1 = 2 * f * E * s;\nterm2 = (1 - f*f) * (1 - E*c);\nC = term1 + term2;\nrawT2 = T1 * E - B * C;\n// Sufficient condition for T/R >= W*cos(alpha) throughout.\n// If false, this simplified branch is not established. Use V18.\ncontactBound = W * R * (2 - c);\ncontactConfirmed = T1 >= contactBound;\nformulaApplicable = valid && contactConfirmed;\nT2 = formulaApplicable && rawT2 >= 0 ? rawT2 : null;\nstatus = valid ? (formulaApplicable ? (rawT2 >= 0 ? \"Taut solution\" : \"Loss of taut tension - use general solver\") : \"Contact branch not established - use V18\") : \"Invalid input\";"
