        "Title": "4 | Solver and Excel export",
        "DescriptionText": "The calculation. Everything on the left feeds this node.\n- V16: actual 3D geometry, converged tension and both direction checks: Main calculation: reads the XY and Z reports, builds the 3D route, integrates tension both ways, checks tension, sidewall pressure and bend radius, writes the Excel report.",
