      {
        "Id": "b58141f8ebfb4f359e82599beb26ed3f",
        "Title": "7 | Section type examples",
        "DescriptionText": "Worked examples of each section type. Independent of the route solver.\n- Entry tension T1 [N]: Example input value.\n- 00 - Common quantities: W and f shared by all the worked examples.\n- 01 - Straight or Horizontal: Worked example of this section type, from T1 to T2.\n- 02 - Slope Up: Worked example of this section type, from T1 to T2.\n- Cable count: Example input value.\n- Mass per cable [kg/m]: Example input value.\n- Gravity [m/s2]: Example input value.\n- Friction coefficient: Example input value.\n- Weight correction â€” selected separately: Example input value.\n- Straight or slope length [m]: Example input value.\n- Bend radius [m]: Example input value.\n- Positive slope or bend angle [degrees]: Example input value.\n- 03 - Slope Down: Worked example of this section type, from T1 to T2.\n- 04 - Concave Downward Bend: Worked example of this section type, from T1 to T2.\n- 05 - Concave Upward Bend: Worked example of this section type, from T1 to T2.\n- 06 - Convex Downward Bend: Worked example of this section type, from T1 to T2.\n- 07 - Convex Upward Bend: Worked example of this section type, from T1 to T2.\n- 08 - Horizontal Bend: Worked example of this section type, from T1 to T2.",
